  "rank_change_1w": "Rank on the same timeframe's board computed 7 calendar days earlier, minus today's rank. Positive means the sector climbed.",
  "persistence": "Measured on weekly snapshots of the trailing 3 years of our derived indices: how often the #1 sector was still in the top 3 four weeks later, and the mean Spearman rank correlation between boards 4 weeks apart. Descriptive statistics of the past, not forecasts."
